        },
        {
          "text": "An Atlas account used to administer the service is separate from a database user used by database clients. Atlan's setup documentation instructs the administrator to create a database user in MongoDB for Atlan and to assign it database privileges through a built-in or custom role. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/organizations-projects.md ; https://docs.atlan.com/apps/connectors/database/mongodb/how-tos/set-up-mongodb.md",
